IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `iv76-nouns`
IMPORT `iv76-cross-references`

-- Row il-76. TESTS OF THE CONTROLS, and the printed values pinned: the sound readings kept beside the defect. They pass.
-- Each control shows that the test finds what it looks for where it is there, so that the failing test in iv76-tests-red.l4 is a finding and not a test that cannot succeed.
-- The expected values are written from the quotation lines in iv76-cross-references.l4 and from the printed pages, not copied from the values there.

§ `Tests of the controls`

-- Control 1: the anchor word occurs in the clause at least once (the count is two).
#ASSERT `the anchor word occurs in the clause at least once` `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)` `the clause as SH 2274 printed it`

-- Control 2: the path the instruction of 2024 names, paragraph (2א) of subsection (ב) of section 39, is the paragraph that SH 2274 item (11)(ב) writes, and its label is the label the instruction prints.
#ASSERT `the two places are the same place` (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`) ((`the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)`'s `the clause it prints`)'s `the place it is printed for`)
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its section` EQUALS (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its section`
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its subsection` EQUALS (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its subsection`
#ASSERT `the label the clause begins with` `the clause as SH 2274 printed it` EQUALS JUST "(2א)"
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its paragraph label` EQUALS JUST "(2א)"

-- Control 3: SH 2420 item (3) names the same paragraph (2א) of subsection (ב) as the place after which something comes, so the paragraph is still named in 2013.
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 2420 item (3)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its section` EQUALS (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its section`
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 2420 item (3)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its subsection` EQUALS (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its subsection`
#ASSERT JUST (`the instruction of SH 2420 item (3)`'s `the paragraph it names`) EQUALS (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its paragraph label`
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 2420` `SH 2274`
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 3232` `SH 2420`

-- Control 4: the words the instruction of 2024 puts in are not in the clause as printed in 2011.
#ASSERT NOT (`the words put in are contained in the clause` `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)` `the clause as SH 2274 printed it`)

§ `The printed values, pinned`

-- Issue dates: the dates the footers print, not commencement dates.
#ASSERT `SH 2274`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 27 1 2011
#ASSERT `SH 2420`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 11 12 2013
#ASSERT `SH 3232`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 3 7 2024
#ASSERT `the two instruments are two different issues` `SH 2274` `SH 3232`
#ASSERT `SH 2274`'s `its title as a deposited page prints it` EQUALS JUST "חוק ייעול הליכי האכיפה ברשות ניירות ערך (תיקוני חקיקה), התשע״א–2011"
#ASSERT `SH 3232`'s `its title as a deposited page prints it` EQUALS JUST "חוק השקעות משותפות בנאמנות (תיקון מס׳ 31), התשפ״ד–2024"
#ASSERT `SH 2420`'s `its title as a deposited page prints it` EQUALS NOTHING

-- The clause as one string and as 18 words, and what the count is made of.
#ASSERT count ((`the clause as SH 2274 printed it`)'s `its words split on spaces`) EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `the words joined with single spaces` ((`the clause as SH 2274 printed it`)'s `its words split on spaces`) EQUALS (`the clause as SH 2274 printed it`)'s `its words as one string`
#ASSERT `the number of times the word occurs in the clause` `the clause as SH 2274 printed it` "סעיף" EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the number of times the anchor word occurs in the clause` `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)` `the clause as SH 2274 printed it` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT (`the clause as SH 2274 printed it`)'s `the count the row types` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the positions of the word from` 1 "סעיף" ((`the clause as SH 2274 printed it`)'s `its words split on spaces`) EQUALS LIST 11, 17
#ASSERT count (filter (GIVEN t YIELD CONTAINS t "סעיף") ((`the clause as SH 2274 printed it`)'s `its words split on spaces`)) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the number of times the word occurs in the clause` `the clause as SH 2274 printed it` "5," EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the number of times the word occurs in the clause` `the clause as SH 2274 printed it` "בסעיף" EQUALS 0
#ASSERT ((`the clause as SH 2274 printed it`)'s `its words as one string`) EQUALS CONCAT "(2א) מסר מידע כוזב או מטעה בבקשה לקבלת רישיון לפי סעיף 5, ", "או בדיווח לרשות לפי סעיף 27."

-- The instruction of 2011 that prints the clause.
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)`'s `the item` EQUALS "(11)(ב)"
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)`'s `the section of the instrument` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)`'s `the paragraph it prints the clause after` EQUALS "(2)"
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)`'s `the clause it prints`)'s `the item that prints it` EQUALS "(11)(ב)"
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 2274 item (11)(bet)`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 245

-- The instruction of 2024, as the components the page prints.
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the section of the instrument` EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the item` EQUALS "(6)"
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 995
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its section` EQUALS 39
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the place it names`)'s `its subsection` EQUALS JUST Bet
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the word it prints before the anchor word` EQUALS "אחרי"
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the anchor word` EQUALS "סעיף"
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the word it prints before the words put in` EQUALS "יבוא"
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 3232 item (6)`'s `the words put in` EQUALS "3(א4)(3), (ד) או"

-- The instruction of 2013, as the line the page prints; it names a paragraph and no word of it, and the words it puts are not typed.
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 2420 item (3)`'s `the item` EQUALS "(3)"
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 2420 item (3)`'s `the section of the instrument` EQUALS 38
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 2420 item (3)`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 133
#ASSERT `the instruction of SH 2420 item (3)`'s `the words it puts` EQUALS NOTHING

-- The headings: the section of each instrument that carries the instructions on the Law, and what the page shows beside it.
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 2274 section 2`'s `the section of the instrument` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 2420 section 38`'s `the section of the instrument` EQUALS 38
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 3232 section 18`'s `the section of the instrument` EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 2274 section 2`'s `the printed page of its heading` EQUALS 239
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 2420 section 38`'s `the printed page of its heading` EQUALS 130
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 3232 section 18`'s `the printed page of its heading` EQUALS 993
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 2420 section 38`'s `the heading words as printed` EQUALS `the instruction set of SH 3232 section 18`'s `the heading words as printed`
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 2420 section 38`'s `the margin note as printed` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the instruction set of SH 2420 section 38`'s `the cover's line for the Law as printed` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`the instruction set of SH 2274 section 2`'s `the margin note as printed` EQUALS `the instruction set of SH 3232 section 18`'s `the margin note as printed`)

-- Commencement. SH 3232 prints a period of three months from publication and no calendar date; SH 2274's is not looked for.
#ASSERT `the commencement printed in SH 3232 section 20(alef)`'s `the number of months after publication the page prints` EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `the commencement printed in SH 3232 section 20(alef)`'s `the date the page prints` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the commencement printed in SH 3232 section 20(alef)`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 996
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2274` EQUALS NOTHING

-- The tags the consolidation's heading line of section 39 carries (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY): seven, and the two that name the instruments of 2011 and 2024.
#ASSERT count `the tags on the heading of section 39 in the consolidation (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY)` EQUALS 7
#ASSERT elem "תשע״א" `the tags on the heading of section 39 in the consolidation (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY)`
#ASSERT elem "תשפ״ד" `the tags on the heading of section 39 in the consolidation (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY)`

-- The six instruments read and not deposited, and how the row holds them.
#ASSERT count `the instruments read and not deposited` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `how it was read` EQUALS `not deposited, not shown by any deposit of this row`) `the instruments read and not deposited`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD `the two instruments are two different issues` (r's `the instrument`) `SH 3232`) `the instruments read and not deposited`

-- The item and how each limb was read.
#ASSERT `the item I1`'s `limb (a) was read` EQUALS `official page image`
#ASSERT `the item I1`'s `limb (b) was read` EQUALS `official page image, with the instruments listed in NOTES.md`
